T* (How these papers have been placed in sequence will be made manifest in) Tj
T* (the reading of them. All needless matters have been eliminated, so that) Tj
T* (a history almost at variance with the possibilities of later-day belief) Tj
T* (may stand forth as simple fact. There is throughout no statement of) Tj
T* (past things wherein memory may err, for all the records chosen are) Tj
T* (exactly contemporary, given from the standpoints and within the range) Tj
T* (of knowledge of those who made them.) Tj
